{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1000_p", "source_sha256": "61adf41d498c0b27bf2a0e23a18a70326a603bebbd7cd892f1ac168a0873759a", "ja": "（『ShineLight』公演の本番が近づいている。\n百合子に用があるんだけど、どこにいるかな……？）", "zh": "（《ShineLight》公演的正式演出越来越近了。我有事要找百合子，她现在在哪儿呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "ccd9658a0ab9f76ff25e80952482c60c9307d6820b0cf1a94d1087f599e224c6", "ja": "はあ～。強くなった仲間たちが続々と集まって……。\n何度読んでも最高だなぁ。私も頑張らないと……。", "zh": "哈啊～。变得更强的伙伴们陆续聚集起来……  \n无论读多少遍都棒极了。我也得加油才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0f6da48cad6f14c967105e48b620625482f01736fbc4242bf74e731561f88d36", "ja": "おっ、百合子！　お疲れさま。\n何してたんだ？", "zh": "哦，百合子！辛苦了。\n刚才在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "8802a7153d0735e6d15e616cd92cbd074692dd79eebdc1d1952c512b51870d4d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n今、お気に入りの冒険小説を読み返してたんです。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我刚才正在重读自己喜欢的冒险小说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "8da3d00267e7563467d2ab783db877769374bd5a45018945d4af2fec7708ab82", "ja": "最新巻の発売が近いので、\nその前に復習をしておこうと思って。", "zh": "最新卷就快发售了，\n所以想在那之前先复习一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8f2ab5c70c609edc530bcb0d9476d05c351d1742101f37f3ab780121c8a3047", "ja": "邪悪な軍勢を倒すため、仲間たちは絆を深めて、\nついに決戦の地へ……っていう、いいところなんです！", "zh": "为了打倒邪恶的军势，同伴们加深了羁绊，\n终于来到了决战之地……正好读到精彩的地方呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0c329d915e8de9671d3543025d50dad28c42fbf30b562625792963d7a37570b6", "ja": "なるほど。読者が続きが気になるように、\nヒキを上手く作ってあるわけだ。", "zh": "原来如此。为了让读者想知道后续，特意把悬念设置得很巧妙啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "b215dcf305913f1929eb0bdfd706f41d8dd41aad7526b06cb81404efc447c065", "ja": "はい！　王道の展開だってわかってますけど……\n読んでると、やっぱり力が入っちゃって。", "zh": "是的！我知道这是王道展开，可是……\n读着读着，还是会不由自主地紧张起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "28cec57254bd755bef07b8cfdfcc76c987eb9c6a8f05ebf60893421eccc9a054", "ja": "私たちの公演も、もうすぐ本番ですから。\n感情移入できるところが多いんですよね……はあ～。", "zh": "我们的演出也快到正式上台的时候了。\n里面有好多地方都能感同身受……哈啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1009_p", "source_sha256": "aa6e305d720c51577f578d27992c54eb30b4ed720816554c8105b8c9d451a16c", "ja": "なるほど。気持ちはできてるってところか。\nそんな百合子に、言っておく事がある。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，情绪已经酝酿好了。\n有件事要告诉这样的百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "c60f56131d88784a2ea3e76cd662ab0f721ca702445c03989ca28d1882c2598d", "ja": "えっ……なんですか？", "zh": "诶……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b9ffd8f3d796d01007a8c07cd839df1ac95024f1dd8de03891929eae16c31c35", "ja": "今日、レッスンの予約入れてたよな？\nもうすぐだから、一応リマインドしとこうと思って。", "zh": "今天预约了课程，对吧？\n马上就要开始了，所以我想先提醒你一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "efb90c2a9661214d80d6af21423f1a3b18f33f0769c9a87b85fc4f6db48e7052", "ja": "え、あれ……！？　あ、ああっ！\nもうそんな時間だったなんて！", "zh": "诶，那个……！？啊、啊啊！\n没想到已经到这个时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "d1b2f7e8f2a472fa30f4858fbe5102fe5e610cc4820a5039afebcc7bc5ff2825", "ja": "大変、早く着替えないと！\n読書って、本当にタイムマシンみたいで……うぅ！", "zh": "糟了，得赶紧换衣服才行！\n看书真的就跟坐时光机一样……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1014_p", "source_sha256": "864f1491719519ee4c9e48fdc1d4ef9a966f10d5040e1a27a474f09c50d433c7", "ja": "念のため、声を掛けに来てよかったよ。\n頑張ってな！", "zh": "过来叫你一声真是来对了。\n加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "1458c995bbb0c45d14926339b7739be3687c36015bd9648c126afb122dfaaa96", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\nそれじゃ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生！\n那我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0373_1016_p", "source_sha256": "61a7f25961ae7ccccfeb0b7d500d54c292cb757a2c0dcfda07f43a7b2e3dab4f", "ja": "（百合子が仲間と共に向かうステージが、\nどんなものになるのか……ヒキはバッチリだな！）", "zh": "（百合子和伙伴们即将登上的舞台，会呈现出什么样子呢……铺垫做得很到位啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
